# This directory stores evaluation run result artifacts produced by:
#   python -m app.cli evaluate --mode=<MODE>
#
# Result files follow the naming convention:
#   YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS-<MODE>.json
#
# latest.json always points to the most recent run result.
#
# All result files must validate against:
#   docs/evaluation/results.schema.json
#
# Do NOT commit live provider result files without review.
# Deterministic/Replay/Historical results may be committed as evidence.
